Enhance your mental attacks with a single gesture. You gain [+2, +4, +6, +8, +10 (TL1-5)] mindpower and [+1%, +2%, +3%, +4%, +6% (TL1-5)] chance to inflict critical damage with mind-based attacks (current chance is [0%, 0%, 13%, 28%, 43% (STR 10-100; CUN 10-100; LUCK 10-100; PP 10-100)]).

Requires two free or mindstar-equipped hands; does not require Gesture of Pain to be sustained.
